OakRTB OpenRTB Protocol
Copyright 2026 oakrtb

This project defines a machine-readable bidding protocol compatible with
IAB Tech Lab OpenRTB 2.6 (aligned dated snapshot 2.6-202606).

The object names, JSON field names, and protocol semantics follow the
OpenRTB 2.6 specification published by IAB Tech Lab, which is licensed
under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0:

  https://github.com/InteractiveAdvertisingBureau/openrtb2.x
  https://iabtechlab.com/standards/openrtb/

Enumerated list values are aligned with AdCOM 1.0:

  https://github.com/InteractiveAdvertisingBureau/AdCOM
